Description: Termux Desktop — Full Linux desktop environment for Android
 Converts any Android phone into a working Linux desktop using XFCE.
 Supports three display modes: Termux:X11 (hardware-accelerated),
 xRDP (Windows Remote Desktop), and noVNC (browser access).
 .
 Setup, app installation, and theming run automatically right after
 install — no manual steps required. Re-run any time with the
 scripts placed in your home directory: setup.sh, start-desktop.sh,
 manage-apps.sh, theme.sh, dashboard.sh.
 .
 Homepage: https://github.com/Tanmay-1122/Termux-desktop

